1
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:17,500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

2
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:21,380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

3
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:24,420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:29,140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

5
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:33,220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

6
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:37,500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

7
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:40,780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

8
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:49,300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

9
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,380
♪Together, they are known♪

10
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:56,660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

11
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:31,900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

12
00:01:32,060 --> 00:01:34,980
[Episode 8]
[This story is purely fictional]

13
00:01:36,790 --> 00:01:38,020
If I were writing this play,

14
00:01:38,790 --> 00:01:39,660
the shadow would be this man,

15
00:01:40,430 --> 00:01:41,330
Yin Changsheng himself.

16
00:01:44,350 --> 00:01:45,820
He probably took one of his own pills

17
00:01:46,590 --> 00:01:48,130
and became neither human nor ghost.

18
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:53,460
Quite a show

19
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,100
has unfolded in this tower.

20
00:02:24,750 --> 00:02:27,940
Squire Wang donated 300 liang of silver.

21
00:02:28,590 --> 00:02:31,610
Squire Zhang donated a pair of ruyi scepters.

22
00:02:45,310 --> 00:02:45,980
I don't believe it.

23
00:02:46,910 --> 00:02:47,730
There must be

24
00:02:47,750 --> 00:02:49,130
some plot we haven't noticed.

25
00:02:51,310 --> 00:02:52,570
What other plot could there be?

26
00:02:53,150 --> 00:02:54,010
So many things have happened here

27
00:02:54,030 --> 00:02:54,940
that don't make sense.

28
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,380
My men have vanished,

29
00:02:56,870 --> 00:02:57,850
and you can't catch up with yours.

30
00:02:58,280 --> 00:02:59,290
We closed our eyes,

31
00:02:59,470 --> 00:03:00,820
and we all ended up in another space.

32
00:03:01,150 --> 00:03:02,010
Once you admit

33
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,660
Yin Changsheng's tricks really work,

34
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:05,850
everything makes sense.

35
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:07,940
What other answer

36
00:03:09,030 --> 00:03:10,380
could there possibly be?

37
00:03:22,470 --> 00:03:23,890
I don't believe any of it.

38
00:03:29,910 --> 00:03:33,890
Tiezui, how I miss you!

39
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:40,610
Master Zhang?

40
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:42,690
Laogou?

41
00:03:46,310 --> 00:03:47,220
Stinky Yu?

42
00:03:48,750 --> 00:03:49,220
Eighth Master.

43
00:03:52,430 --> 00:03:54,220
Stinky Yu, am I glad to see you!

44
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:56,010
Let's find the others.

45
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:56,660
All right.

46
00:03:57,850 --> 00:03:58,380
Let's go.

47
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,170
They really made it down here!

48
00:04:17,830 --> 00:04:18,450
What happened?

49
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:28,570
The hair on that mural was poisonous.

50
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,020
It shouldn't be too serious.

51
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,770
I've survived Blood Corpse poison before.

52
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,860
Let's hurry and meet up with them.

53
00:04:48,950 --> 00:04:49,820
The poisoning isn't severe,

54
00:04:50,910 --> 00:04:51,890
but your pulse is too fast.

55
00:04:54,590 --> 00:04:55,540
Rest here.

56
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:57,330
I'll go find Tiezui.

57
00:04:57,670 --> 00:04:59,330
Don't move until I return.

58
00:06:43,190 --> 00:06:43,980
Runty.

59
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:46,370
Runty.

60
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,050
An illusion...

61
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:25,930
This is an illusion.

62
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:29,100
Enough of these tricks.

63
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:32,980
Yin Changsheng, what do you want?

64
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:54,660
Laogou.

65
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:56,660
Laogou!

66
00:07:58,190 --> 00:07:58,700
I'm coming.

67
00:07:59,950 --> 00:08:00,730
I'm coming to you.

68
00:08:08,390 --> 00:08:08,930
Xiaoyu.

69
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:13,900
- Master! - Master Zhang!

70
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:16,780
My dear Master Zhang!

71
00:08:16,830 --> 00:08:19,610
Master Zhang, I've missed you so much!

72
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,490
My dear Master Zhang,

73
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:24,410
we've searched everywhere for you.

74
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:26,220
Are you all right?

75
00:08:27,310 --> 00:08:28,050
Are you hurt?

76
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:28,930
I'm fine.

77
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:32,650
Thank goodness.

78
00:08:36,750 --> 00:08:37,370
Where's Laogou?

79
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:38,890
He's been poisoned,

80
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,180
but he's out of danger.

81
00:08:40,550 --> 00:08:41,730
He's resting elsewhere for now.

82
00:08:43,150 --> 00:08:43,770
Good.

83
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:44,580
By the way,

84
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:45,580
just now,

85
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,940
we got a message from Laogou's bird, Tu.

86
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:50,730
So it really is some kind of visual trick.

87
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,060
Otherwise,

88
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:53,730
Tu couldn't have flown from where you were

89
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,010
and made it back to us.

90
00:08:55,390 --> 00:08:56,220
If it's a trick,

91
00:08:56,390 --> 00:08:57,060
that makes things easier.

92
00:08:57,270 --> 00:08:58,180
It doesn't, Master Zhang.

93
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,460
We've searched all this way,

94
00:08:59,510 --> 00:09:01,420
but still haven't figured out how the mechanism works.

95
00:09:07,750 --> 00:09:09,130
Isn't that Laogou's whistle?

96
00:09:11,150 --> 00:09:13,010
Didn't you say he was resting?

97
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:14,650
He always does as he pleases.

98
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:15,580
Xiaojin.

99
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:16,250
Yes.

100
00:09:16,630 --> 00:09:18,010
Tell Fifth Master to meet us at the stage.

101
00:09:18,270 --> 00:09:18,820
The rest of you, follow me.

102
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:19,220
Yes.

103
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:19,650
Hurry.

104
00:09:43,870 --> 00:09:45,580
This is where the Three Worms were hiding.

105
00:09:48,030 --> 00:09:49,130
"Madam Wang's Lecture"?

106
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:52,980
This play isn't that old.

107
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,980
It was originally a story in Li Yu's "Silent Dramas"

108
00:09:55,550 --> 00:09:57,420
and wasn't adapted for the stage until the 15th year of Guangxu.

109
00:09:58,720 --> 00:09:59,580
Then that means

110
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:01,890
this place was built in the Qing dynasty.

111
00:10:02,390 --> 00:10:03,700
Yin Changsheng built it.

112
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:05,530
Yin Changsheng?

113
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:09,610
Master Zhang,

114
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:10,650
then this...

115
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:12,420
this stage is no ordinary one.

116
00:10:15,390 --> 00:10:15,890
Follow me.

117
00:10:24,030 --> 00:10:24,580
Miss Huo.

118
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:30,530
Let's go.

119
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:45,300
- Master! - Master!

120
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:45,890
Heifeng.

121
00:10:46,550 --> 00:10:47,060
Juanlian.

122
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:48,840
Are you all right?

123
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:49,350
We're fine.

124
00:10:50,670 --> 00:10:51,180
Xiangu.

125
00:10:52,030 --> 00:10:52,460
Xiangu!

126
00:10:57,150 --> 00:10:57,610
Laogou,

127
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:59,100
what happened to you?

128
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:01,460
I heard your whistles,

129
00:11:01,670 --> 00:11:02,610
so I came to meet you.

130
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:03,770
It's dangerous here.

131
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:04,700
This place is dangerous!

132
00:11:04,750 --> 00:11:05,370
Where's Zhang Qishan?

133
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:08,060
We got separated.

134
00:11:08,510 --> 00:11:09,420
I got separated from him.

135
00:11:10,030 --> 00:11:10,610
Master,

136
00:11:11,030 --> 00:11:12,490
you seem a little...

137
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:13,530
Poison.

138
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:15,610
There's poison here.

139
00:11:15,910 --> 00:11:16,610
Don't touch anything.

140
00:11:18,910 --> 00:11:19,370
Master,

141
00:11:20,150 --> 00:11:21,460
why don't you rest for a while?

142
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:24,130
I'll get you out.

143
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:25,580
I have to get you out.

144
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:26,890
I'm really worried.

145
00:11:27,790 --> 00:11:28,940
What's happened here?

146
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:30,490
Yes...

147
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:32,220
I need to get you out.

148
00:11:32,670 --> 00:11:33,730
Your lives matter more than mine.

149
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:35,100
I'll get you out.

150
00:11:35,510 --> 00:11:36,370
I'll get you out.

151
00:11:36,750 --> 00:11:37,490
Where's the exit?

152
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:38,730
Where's the exit?

153
00:11:40,630 --> 00:11:41,180
Miss Huo,

154
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:43,100
what's...

155
00:11:44,270 --> 00:11:45,250
what's wrong with Master?

156
00:11:46,750 --> 00:11:47,820
He is acting rather strangely.

157
00:11:59,550 --> 00:12:00,060
Tiezui,

158
00:12:01,150 --> 00:12:03,490
is that man up there Yin Changsheng?

159
00:12:06,670 --> 00:12:07,770
That tall hat

160
00:12:09,030 --> 00:12:11,890
and the entire abode built on a great ghost...

161
00:12:13,270 --> 00:12:15,100
It really is Yin Changsheng, Master Zhang.

162
00:12:17,670 --> 00:12:20,340
No wonder this place is so strange.

163
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:22,250
It was built

164
00:12:22,270 --> 00:12:23,850
in the image of Fengdu.

165
00:12:25,600 --> 00:12:26,940
If it really is him,

166
00:12:28,630 --> 00:12:29,820
we're in serious trouble!

167
00:12:30,790 --> 00:12:32,770
Stop being mysterious. Speak plainly.

168
00:12:34,750 --> 00:12:35,300
Master Zhang,

169
00:12:35,870 --> 00:12:36,820
this immortal

170
00:12:36,870 --> 00:12:37,730
was rather peculiar

171
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:38,940
and loved playing tricks.

172
00:12:39,670 --> 00:12:40,130
And

173
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:42,130
look at the layout.

174
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:45,030
This seems to be his tomb.

175
00:12:45,510 --> 00:12:46,060
Could he be

176
00:12:46,630 --> 00:12:47,650
buried here?

177
00:12:50,390 --> 00:12:51,530
This doesn't look like an ancient tomb.

178
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:54,300
It seems to be a place for studying magic.

179
00:12:54,750 --> 00:12:55,100
Master Zhang,

180
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:56,850
that's where you're mistaken.

181
00:12:57,960 --> 00:12:59,130
A mystic's tomb

182
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:01,010
and a place for studying magic

183
00:13:01,510 --> 00:13:03,060
are often indistinguishable.

184
00:13:03,910 --> 00:13:06,650
So was he a mystic or an immortal?

185
00:13:08,030 --> 00:13:09,340
According to folklore,

186
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:10,490
he was certainly an immortal.

187
00:13:11,480 --> 00:13:12,060
But

188
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:14,130
what the truth was

189
00:13:15,150 --> 00:13:16,820
can no longer be verified.

190
00:13:20,150 --> 00:13:20,850
Take a look

191
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:21,850
at these vats

192
00:13:23,390 --> 00:13:24,530
and tell me what the symbols mean.

193
00:13:29,670 --> 00:13:30,980
These symbols

194
00:13:32,720 --> 00:13:34,180
are all suppression talismans.

195
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:37,300
There must be something evil sealed inside the vats.

196
00:13:38,670 --> 00:13:40,130
These lids must never be opened.

197
00:13:41,510 --> 00:13:42,130
That's it?

198
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:47,460
Well, I...

199
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:50,180
I'll go study the mural.

200
00:13:51,440 --> 00:13:52,420
We've already done that.

201
00:13:55,440 --> 00:13:56,250
You have?

202
00:13:58,030 --> 00:13:59,820
So you and Laogou

203
00:13:59,960 --> 00:14:01,130
have seen everything worth seeing?

204
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:03,220
Then let's leave.

205
00:14:03,910 --> 00:14:05,460
If we find the mechanism and get out within two hours,

206
00:14:06,270 --> 00:14:07,610
we can still make it back for dinner.

207
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:10,580
It seems you refuse to use your real skills.

208
00:14:11,200 --> 00:14:13,010
Then it makes no difference whether you're here or not.

209
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:14,420
Spread the word:

210
00:14:14,550 --> 00:14:16,060
Eighth Master looks down on me, Zhang Qishan.

211
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:16,890
Did everyone hear that?

212
00:14:18,630 --> 00:14:19,650
Master Zhang...

213
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:21,770
Master Zhang,

214
00:14:22,510 --> 00:14:22,980
look at me.

215
00:14:25,120 --> 00:14:27,490
My eyes are practically glowing.

216
00:14:27,870 --> 00:14:28,420
Rest assured.

217
00:14:29,240 --> 00:14:31,650
I promise I'll find something useful.

218
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:45,530
Let me check the layout.

219
00:15:02,670 --> 00:15:03,300
Master Zhang,

220
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:06,890
does the mural

221
00:15:07,550 --> 00:15:08,730
show a stage?

222
00:15:12,360 --> 00:15:13,460
The mechanism that leads us out

223
00:15:13,630 --> 00:15:14,980
is hidden in the stage.

224
00:15:29,150 --> 00:15:30,610
Military manual on the left, wooden sword on the right.

225
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:32,180
Have Madam Wang hand them over. Quick.

226
00:16:34,390 --> 00:16:34,820
Master,

227
00:16:35,080 --> 00:16:35,770
a door opened.

228
00:16:38,080 --> 00:16:38,580
Continue.

229
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:42,850
Give the abacus to the son.

230
00:16:43,270 --> 00:16:44,220
The ledger goes to Madam Wang.

231
00:16:44,390 --> 00:16:45,010
Open it to a page,

232
00:16:45,150 --> 00:16:46,060
as though she's teaching him bookkeeping.

233
00:17:09,510 --> 00:17:11,140
Master, another door opened.

234
00:17:18,110 --> 00:17:19,140
Two doors really did open.

235
00:17:19,480 --> 00:17:20,770
Impressive, Eighth Master.

236
00:17:23,310 --> 00:17:24,300
People

237
00:17:24,990 --> 00:17:26,730
are so caught up in the classics,

238
00:17:27,440 --> 00:17:30,050
yet they forget there are countless trades,

239
00:17:30,320 --> 00:17:32,020
and every trade has its masters.

240
00:17:36,120 --> 00:17:36,570
Master Zhang,

241
00:17:36,880 --> 00:17:38,330
we now have two paths.

242
00:17:38,990 --> 00:17:41,010
One is probably safe, the other deadly.

243
00:17:41,640 --> 00:17:42,690
Which one do we take?

244
00:17:43,390 --> 00:17:44,580
Which do you think we should take?

245
00:17:49,480 --> 00:17:50,980
- I think we should... - This one, then.

246
00:17:52,160 --> 00:17:52,380
Wait.

247
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:53,570
Master Zhang!

248
00:17:57,350 --> 00:17:59,010
Master Zhang, aren't we waiting for Laogou?

249
00:17:59,550 --> 00:18:00,460
Xiangu can look after him.

250
00:18:01,440 --> 00:18:02,220
Leave him a sign.

251
00:18:11,380 --> 00:18:13,220
[Nine]

252
00:18:13,510 --> 00:18:14,180
- Zhang Qishan! - Master Zhang!

253
00:18:14,960 --> 00:18:15,380
Master Zhang!

254
00:18:16,110 --> 00:18:16,660
- Zhang Qishan! - Master Zhang!

255
00:18:16,750 --> 00:18:17,330
Master Zhang!

256
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:20,180
Master Zhang!

257
00:18:23,110 --> 00:18:24,570
We agreed to meet at the stage.

258
00:18:25,350 --> 00:18:26,250
Where is everyone?

259
00:18:29,830 --> 00:18:30,250
Laogou,

260
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:32,380
could Master Zhang and the others

261
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:34,010
have gone through these two openings?

262
00:18:35,550 --> 00:18:36,700
Zhang Qishan left without me?

263
00:18:38,680 --> 00:18:39,420
These two openings

264
00:18:41,110 --> 00:18:41,900
weren't here before.

265
00:18:46,550 --> 00:18:47,660
There's no other way out,

266
00:18:48,400 --> 00:18:49,220
so let's go in first.

267
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:57,940
This way.

268
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:06,420
Master,

269
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:08,420
what happened earlier?

270
00:19:08,720 --> 00:19:09,770
This place is deeply sinister.

271
00:19:10,270 --> 00:19:11,250
As soon as we find a way out,

272
00:19:11,510 --> 00:19:12,250
we'll leave.

273
00:19:12,310 --> 00:19:12,900
Laogou.

274
00:19:13,640 --> 00:19:14,050
Laogou.

275
00:19:17,350 --> 00:19:17,980
Calm down.

276
00:19:24,590 --> 00:19:25,530
There's something I need to tell you.

277
00:19:39,790 --> 00:19:40,290
Master,

278
00:19:40,640 --> 00:19:41,420
the hand

279
00:19:41,440 --> 00:19:42,860
we saw in Liunian Hall...

280
00:19:43,350 --> 00:19:44,380
Was it yours?

281
00:19:46,960 --> 00:19:47,620
I don't know.

282
00:19:50,030 --> 00:19:50,900
Then how do you explain

283
00:19:51,640 --> 00:19:52,620
this button?

284
00:19:53,350 --> 00:19:54,250
I really don't know.

285
00:19:55,550 --> 00:19:56,770
But at the time you mentioned,

286
00:19:57,270 --> 00:19:58,900
I was indeed with Zhang Qishan.

287
00:19:59,790 --> 00:20:00,900
So where did this button come from?

288
00:20:02,070 --> 00:20:03,140
And how could that have been my hand?

289
00:20:04,510 --> 00:20:06,180
If someone vanished, we could blame it on spirits clouding our sight.

290
00:20:06,590 --> 00:20:07,980
But how do you explain something

